1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
(Sheldon:)You have to help--
it's in the roommate agreement.

2
00:00:02,570 --> 00:00:04,080
(Leonard:)No, it's not.

3
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:08,390
(Sheldon:)Section 74.C.

4
00:00:08,390 --> 00:00:10,910
(Sheldon:)The various obligations
and duties of the parties

5
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:14,540
(Sheldon:)in the event one of
them becomes a robot.

6
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:18,230
(Leonard:)I'll be damned.

7
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,390
(Sheldon-bot:)This is delightful.

8
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:32,390
(Leonard:)Uh-huh.

9
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,680
(Sheldon-bot:)It's much easier to enjoy

10
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,680
(Sheldon-bot:)the picturesque route
we travel to work

11
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:39,900
when you remove the specter
of fiery vehicular death.

12
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,190
(Leonard:)Refresh my memory.

13
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:43,740
(Leonard:)Why didn't I just put you
in the trunk?

14
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:46,740
(Sheldon-bot:)Because I called shotgun.
Remember?

15
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,410
(Penny:)Right.

16
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:55,750
(Sheldon-bot:)You seem tense.

17
00:00:55,750 --> 00:01:07,030
(Sheldon-bot:)Perhaps this will relax you.

